                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When congressional Republicans and the Trump administration forced through the largest health care cuts in history, they put hospitals up and down our state at risk.\n\nThey were so desperate to give rich people tax cuts, they made it harder for Americans everywhere to get care.",
