                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Why are Republicans lying to you?\n\nBecause they voted to take health care away from 15 MILLION Americans, and raise YOUR premiums. \n\nDon't buy their lies. We're fighting to restore access to care and stop Republican price hikes. https://t.co/VmkCaikOoC",
