                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This morning, the federal government shut down because Republicans refused to negotiate.\n\nPremiums are set to double. 15 million Americans are losing their health insurance. All to protect their billionaire tax breaks.\n\nIt's time for Republicans to come to the table.",
