                "text": "If Republicans were serious, they'd be listening to the people who are saying: 'please don't take away our care'.\n\u00a0\nIf Republicans were serious, they wouldn't stand by while health insurance premiums double.\n\u00a0\nIt's time for Republicans to get serious. https://t.co/dy2DzKj6WG",
