                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This is yet another attempt to mislead you\u2014 rates aren't set in December, they're going out NOW.\n\nWhile Republicans pretend like it's no big deal, millions of our friends and neighbors are about to be priced out of their coverage. https://t.co/ijJzPaJoN7",
