                "text": "Thanks to Republicans in Washington, a 50-year-old couple in Middletown will see their premiums go up by 224% this Saturday.\n\nAre there any Delawareans who want to spend more than $1,200 extra PER MONTH for their health coverage? https://t.co/fqKUVDwDbc",
