                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 143,
                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The president is willing to try everything - including unproven strategies that undercut Americans\u2019 bargaining power - to avoid extending tax credits that we KNOW will bring premiums down.\n\nIt\u2019s time for Republicans to get serious about addressing this health care crisis. https://t.co/WDFAi5pIHp",
